Last week, I posted that my priest Zorachus had lost his quest
adversary.  Even after thousands of turns, Nalzok, the Bell of Opening
and the Mitre of Holiness were still MIA.  

There was one last thing I wanted to try.  Zorachus steps on a level
teleport trap, enters a high number to get down to the first level of
Gehennom, then goes up one level into the castle.  Several hundred dead
monsters later, he reaches the wand of wishing.

He tries for a Platinum Yendorian Express Card but this doesn't work.
The message is something like `you feel something in your hands, but
then it disappears!'  So wish #2 goes for a scroll of charging and with
#3 he tries for the Bell of Opening.  An ordinary bell appears.

It seems like kind of a bug that the quest nemesis can escape this way
with the indispensible Bell of Opening unless he is going to reappear
eventually.  Anyone have any information about this?  Should I report it
as a bug?

